unit: manifest entry
id: has_wwan_module_via_at_command
_name: WWAN module controlled via AT commands
_prompt:
  Is this WWAN module's data connection established and verified
  using raw AT commands sent directly over its serial control
  interface (WWAN_CONTROL_IF), instead of via ModemManager?
value-type: bool

unit: manifest entry
id: has_wwan_hotspot
_name: WWAN module used as a USB hotspot
_prompt:
  Does this device have a WWAN module attached as a USB cdc-acm
  device?
value-type: bool
